 "structural_change": "L2H-WBK 10-19 successor of hbm_wbk_q_1018 (gate FAIL OT_MULTI_ROOT: kit reset landing put hbm_rst_n on stream_clk): RTL lands each reset in its own clock domain (2 plain stages per domain at the face), landed resets drive the core; cross-domain reset combination unchanged inside u_wb (per-domain ot_reset_sync). Same floorplan/macros/pins. | prior: NEW hard top for d4g wbk_<q> x4 (ot_hbm_svc_wb_kport_q over ot_hbm_svc_wb_cutthrough_cdc #(NPC 16, QFOLD 1)); GEN0 bound the per-stack ot_hbm_svc_wb_kport as a SYNTH ETM. CDC gate fix (HBM-WBK 10-18): K-port skid loads the FIFO head only when that FIFO is non-empty (k_v && !fifo_empty[selected_lane]); unreachable difference in the static schedule (req_valid[pc] -> !fifo_empty[req_lane[pc]] holds: the latched lane was non-empty and only its own PC pops it), 20 bench logs old==new",
 "slot_change_request": "d4g wbk_<q> x4: new slot 777.6 x 518.4 (pin-bound: N = 16 K ports 4,626 pins at 5.95/um toward the quadrant's 4 vmks leaves; S = DMA wd 2,312 + stream control at 3.2/um toward hb_dbk_<q>); 32 payload SRAMs as 4 abutted 8-high columns (one per stream_fifo_clk root) on the 43.2 lattice",
